fra, D.R.I. (thrash antes que Metallica), Flipper. Los «beach punks» de Los Ángeles: Germs, X, Black Flag (Damaged), Descendents, Gun Club (Fire Of Love), Bad Religion. El jazz-core de Minutemen y Saccharine Trust; en el Medio Oeste, Husker Du y Replacements cambian el hardcore para siempre; en Chicago, Naked Raygun y Big Black de Steve Albini; en Europa, The Ex y los italianos CCCP.","color":"#fb7185","family":"Punk, new wave, hardcore y noise","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#hardcore"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":52489019675264,"artist":"Dog Faced Hermans","artist_id":267153894152195,"title":"Humans Fly","year":1987,"ess":0,"yt":"NZL9dSOlGis","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Hardcore","scene_id":207755761847598,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#hardcore","chapters":["Sección 5.9"],"pages":[[1,149,null]]},{"id":74418867727892,"artist":"Dog Faced Hermans","artist_id":267153894152195,"title":"Every Day Timebomb","year":1989,"ess":0,"yt":"J4XA-o1vw9c","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Hardcore","scene_id":207755761847598,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#hardcore","chapters":["Sección 5.9"],"pages":[[1,149,null]]},{"id":97717828078737,"artist":"Dog Faced Hermans","artist_id":267153894152195,"title":"Mental Blocks For All Ages","year":1991,"ess":0,"yt":"392i226U5BE","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Hardcore","scene_id":207755761847598,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#hardcore","chapters":["Sección 5.9"],"pages":[[1,149,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":149,"text":"…Blueprints For A Blackout (198